namespace ZeroRelative

/-! ## 1. 桥 1: 自然数 = 圈数 -/

/-- **桥 1: 自然数 = 圈数**: exp(2πi·n) = 1 ∀ n : ℕ — 单位圆旋转
n 圈回到 1 (自然数 = 旋转圈数, 圈数由旋转结构生成, 非公设输入).   Bridge 1: natural numbers = turn counts — exp(2πi·n) = 1 for all n : ℕ. 
English: Bridge 1: natural numbers = winding numbers: exp(2πi·n) = 1 ∀ n : ℕ — n full turns on the unit circle return to 1 (winding numbers generated by rotation structure, not an axiom input). -/
theorem turns_to_one (n : ℕ) :
    Complex.exp (n * (2 * Real.pi * Complex.I)) = 1 := by
  rw [Complex.exp_nat_mul]
  rw [Complex.exp_two_pi_mul_I]
  simp

/-- **桥 1 递推: 圈数加法 = 相位乘法**: exp((n+m)·2πi) = exp(n·2πi)
· exp(m·2πi) — 转 n+m 圈 = 转 n 圈再转 m 圈 (圈数加法与旋转合成
一致, exp_add).   Bridge 1 recursion: turn-count addition = phase multiplication (exp_add). 
English: Bridge 1 recursion: winding-number addition = phase multiplication: exp((n+m)·2πi) = exp(n·2πi) · exp(m·2πi) — n+m turns = n turns then m turns (winding-number addition matches rotation composition, exp_add). -/
theorem circle_count_add (n m : ℕ) :
    Complex.exp ((n + m) * (2 * Real.pi * Complex.I)) =
      Complex.exp (n * (2 * Real.pi * Complex.I)) *
        Complex.exp (m * (2 * Real.pi * Complex.I)) := by
  rw [← Complex.exp_add]
  congr
  apply Complex.ext
  · simp
  · simp
    ring

/-! ## 2. 桥 2: exp 核 = 2πiℤ (对称消去统一) -/

/-- **桥 2: exp 核 = 2πiℤ**: exp(2πi·k) = 1 ∀ k : ℤ — 整圈平移
(正负任意) = 恒等 (周期延拓 × 对称消去的统一: 周期平移对消).   Bridge 2: exp kernel = 2πiℤ — exp(2πi·k) = 1 for all k : ℤ. 
English: Bridge 2: exp kernel = 2πiℤ: exp(2πi·k) = 1 ∀ k : ℤ — integer full-turn translation (any sign) = identity (unification of periodic extension and symmetric cancellation: periodic translation cancels). -/
theorem integer_turns_to_one (k : ℤ) :
    Complex.exp (k * (2 * Real.pi * Complex.I)) = 1 := by
  rw [Complex.exp_int_mul]
  rw [Complex.exp_two_pi_mul_I]
  simp

/-! ## 3. 桥 3: 相位叠加 (乘性 → 加性) -/

/-- **桥 3: 相位叠加**: exp(iθ)·exp(iφ) = exp(i(θ+φ)) — 单位圆上
乘法 = 相位加法 (乘性结构 → 加性结构, exp_add).   Bridge 3: phase superposition — exp(iθ)·exp(iφ) = exp(i(θ+φ)). 
English: Bridge 3: phase superposition: exp(iθ)·exp(iφ) = exp(i(θ+φ)) — multiplication on the unit circle = phase addition (multiplicative structure → additive structure, exp_add). -/
theorem phase_add (θ φ : ℝ) :
    Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I) * Complex.exp (φ * Complex.I) =
      Complex.exp ((θ + φ) * Complex.I) := by
  have hlin : (θ + φ) * Complex.I = θ * Complex.I + φ * Complex.I := by
    apply Complex.ext <;> simp
  rw [hlin, ← Complex.exp_add]

/-- **相位互逆对**: exp(iθ)·exp(-iθ) = 1 — 相位互逆 = 对消对在
单位圆上 (对称消去 × 相位叠加: 相反相位叠加回到 1).   Inverse phase pair: exp(iθ)·exp(-iθ) = 1 (cancellation pair on the unit circle). 
English: Inverse phase pair: exp(iθ)·exp(-iθ) = 1 — phase inverses are the cancellation pair on the unit circle (symmetric cancellation × phase superposition: opposite phases superpose back to 1). -/
theorem phase_inverse (θ : ℝ) :
    Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I) * Complex.exp (-θ * Complex.I) = 1 := by
  have hlin : θ * Complex.I + (-θ) * Complex.I = 0 := by
    apply Complex.ext <;> simp
  rw [← Complex.exp_add, hlin, Complex.exp_zero]

/-- **相位归一**: ‖exp(iθ)‖ = 1 — 相位叠加不离开单位圆 (模恒 1,
只有相位变; exp_mul_I: exp(iθ) = cos θ + i·sin θ, cos²+sin² = 1).   Phase normalization: ‖exp(iθ)‖ = 1 (modulus constantly 1, only phase varies). 
English: Phase normalization: ‖exp(iθ)‖ = 1 — phase superposition never leaves the unit circle (modulus constantly 1, only phase varies; exp_mul_I: exp(iθ) = cos θ + i·sin θ, cos²+sin² = 1). -/
theorem phase_norm_one (θ : ℝ) : ‖Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I)‖ = 1 := by
  have hre : (Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I)).re = Real.cos θ := by
    rw [Complex.exp_mul_I]
    rw [← Complex.ofReal_cos, ← Complex.ofReal_sin]
    rw [Complex.add_re, Complex.mul_re, Complex.I_re, Complex.ofReal_re, Complex.ofReal_im]
    ring
  have him : (Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I)).im = Real.sin θ := by
    rw [Complex.exp_mul_I]
    rw [← Complex.ofReal_cos, ← Complex.ofReal_sin]
    rw [Complex.add_im, Complex.mul_im, Complex.I_re, Complex.I_im, Complex.ofReal_re,
      Complex.ofReal_im]
    ring
  have hsq : ‖Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I)‖ ^ 2 = 1 := by
    rw [← Complex.normSq_eq_norm_sq]
    rw [Complex.normSq_apply, hre, him]
    rw [← Real.cos_sq_add_sin_sq (x := θ)]
    ring_nf
  have hcases : ‖Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I)‖ = 1 ∨ ‖Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I)‖ = -1 :=
    (sq_eq_one_iff).mp hsq
  rcases hcases with h1 | hm1
  · exact h1
  · exfalso
    have hnn : 0 ≤ ‖Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I)‖ := norm_nonneg _
    nlinarith

/-! ## 4. 三桥合取 (统一声明) -/

/-- **三桥统一**: 圈数回到 1 (桥 1) ∧ 整圈平移恒等 (桥 2) ∧ 相位
叠加 (桥 3) — 三桥同时成立, 互为一致 (无冲突).   Three bridges unified: turns return to 1 ∧ integer full-turn translations are identity ∧ phase superposition. 
English: Three bridges unified: winding numbers return to 1 (bridge 1) ∧ integer full-turn translations are identity (bridge 2) ∧ phase superposition (bridge 3) — all three hold simultaneously, mutually consistent (no conflict). -/
theorem three_bridges_unify :
    (∀ n : ℕ, Complex.exp (n * (2 * Real.pi * Complex.I)) = 1) ∧
      (∀ k : ℤ, Complex.exp (k * (2 * Real.pi * Complex.I)) = 1) ∧
        (∀ θ φ : ℝ,
          Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I) * Complex.exp (φ * Complex.I) =
            Complex.exp ((θ + φ) * Complex.I)) := by
  constructor
  · intro n
    exact turns_to_one n
  · constructor
    · intro k
      exact integer_turns_to_one k
    · intro θ φ
      exact phase_add θ φ


/-! ## 5. 通用化: 乘除法对消无视基点移动 (2026-08-22 用户指示) -/

/-- **★乘性基点无关互逆对消**: 任意乘性基点 c (c ≠ 0) 下, z 与
c²/z 的乘积 = c² — 完全对消, 残差只依赖基点 c, 与 z 无关 (无视基点
移动的乘除法消相位; c = 1 时还原为 z·z⁻¹ = 1; 用户: 乘除法能对消
是因为基点锁定在 1 的消解 — 对消律本身不锁基点, 锁的是标度).
   ★Basepoint-free multiplicative cancellation: at any basepoint
c ≠ 0, z·(c²/z) = c² — the residual depends only on c, not on z
(c = 1 recovers z·z⁻¹ = 1). 
English: Basepoint-free multiplicative cancellation: at any basepoint c ≠ 0, z·(c²/z) = c² — cancellation complete, residual depends only on c, not on z (c = 1 recovers z·z⁻¹ = 1; law locks scale, not basepoint). -/
theorem mul_cancel_at_basepoint (c z : ℂ) (hz : z ≠ 0) :
    z * (c ^ 2 / z) = c ^ 2 := by
  field_simp [hz]

/-- **★吸收边界 (c = 0)**: z·(0²/z) = 0 — 乘性基点移动到 0 时,
公式形式上仍等于 c² = 0, 但语义从对消 (还原到 c²) 变成吸收 (0
湮灭 z) — 乘性基点可移动范围 = ℂ\{0} (Absorption.lean 的排除边界;
c = 0 时对消律无信息).   ★Absorption boundary (c = 0): z·(0²/z) =
0 — when the multiplicative basepoint moves to 0, the formula still
formally equals c² = 0 but the semantics change from cancellation
(restoration to c²) to absorption (0 annihilates z) — the movable
range is ℂ\{0}. 
English: Absorption boundary (c = 0): z·(0²/z) = 0 — at basepoint 0 it formally equals c² = 0, but semantics change from cancellation to absorption (0 annihilates z) — movable range = ℂ\{0}, Absorption.lean's excluded boundary. -/
theorem mul_cancel_formula_absorbs_at_zero (z : ℂ) :
    z * (0 ^ 2 / z) = 0 := by
  norm_num [div_eq_mul_inv]

/-- **★相位基点无关互逆对**: 任意相位基点 θ₀ 下, 对称相位对
{θ, 2θ₀ - θ} 的乘积 = exp(2iθ₀) — 完全对消, 残差只依赖基点 θ₀,
与 θ 无关 (无视相位基点移动; θ₀ = 0 时还原为 phase_inverse).
   ★Basepoint-free inverse phase pair: at any phase basepoint θ₀,
the symmetric pair {θ, 2θ₀ - θ} multiplies to exp(2iθ₀) — the
residual depends only on θ₀ (θ₀ = 0 recovers phase_inverse). 
English: Basepoint-free inverse phase pair: at any phase basepoint θ₀, symmetric pair {θ, 2θ₀ - θ} multiplies to exp(2iθ₀) — cancellation complete, residual depends on θ₀, not on θ (θ₀ = 0 → phase_inverse). -/
theorem phase_inverse_at_theta0 (θ₀ θ : ℝ) :
    Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I) * Complex.exp ((2 * θ₀ - θ) * Complex.I) =
      Complex.exp (2 * θ₀ * Complex.I) := by
  rw [← Complex.exp_add]
  congr
  apply Complex.ext <;> simp

/-- **★通用消相位 (乘性)**: 任意相位基点 θ₀ 与任意相位 θ, 存在
对消伙伴 φ = 2θ₀ - θ, 使 exp(iθ)·exp(iφ) = exp(2iθ₀) (残差 =
2·基点相位, 预计算, 与 θ 无关) — 任意消相位的存在性: 基点无关.
   ★Universal phase cancellation: at any phase basepoint θ₀ and any
θ, there exists a partner φ = 2θ₀ - θ with exp(iθ)·exp(iφ) =
exp(2iθ₀). 
English: Universal phase cancellation (multiplicative): at any phase basepoint θ₀ and phase θ, there exists a partner φ = 2θ₀ - θ with exp(iθ)·exp(iφ) = exp(2iθ₀) (residual = 2·basepoint phase, precomputable, independent of θ) — basepoint-independent. -/
theorem universal_phase_cancel (θ₀ θ : ℝ) :
    ∃ φ : ℝ, Complex.exp (θ * Complex.I) * Complex.exp (φ * Complex.I) =
      Complex.exp (2 * θ₀ * Complex.I) := by
  refine ⟨2 * θ₀ - θ, ?_⟩
  simpa using phase_inverse_at_theta0 θ₀ θ

